  <entry>
    <title>HAX art</title>
    <id>item-732218fd-d5a1-48ab-9e81-407e2787d2aa</id>
    <updated>2026-11-11T21:36:21.000Z</updated>
    <published>2026-11-11T21:36:21.000Z</published>
    <summary></summary>
    <link href="https://localhost/hax-art/home"/>
    
    <content type="html">
      <![CDATA[ <p>Art and media from <a href="https://haxtheweb.org">HAX</a>: open-source tools that let anyone create, remix and publish on the web without needing to understand the web. This portfolio is itself a HAXsite, built with the HAX CLI, and every image on it is pulled straight from the <a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art">haxtheweb/art</a> repository.</p>
<media-image source="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/world-traveler/funny-traveler-15.png" alt="The Future Traveler: red helmet with a HAX band, cyan goggles and a green backpack with a lightbulb, chin on his arms, in front of a white starburst in a red circle." caption="The Future Traveler, HAX's official mascot, in his classic pose."></media-image>
<h2>Browse</h2>
<ul><li><a href="world-traveler">Future Traveler: the HAX mascot in every style</a></li><li><a href="rpg-character">rpg-character: games and toys starring HAX's pixel character</a></li><li><a href="brand">Brand: logos, stickers, banners and posters</a></li><li><a href="talks">Talks: diagrams and explainers for presentations</a></li><li><a href="use-the-art">Use the art: attribution, licensing and hotlinking</a></li></ul>
<p><strong>Dream it, remix it, have it, share it.</strong></p> ]]>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>Future Traveler</title>
    <id>item-576d65a3-a6f0-45f6-9991-c576cd394c30</id>
    <updated>2026-11-11T21:36:21.000Z</updated>
    <published>2026-11-11T21:36:21.000Z</published>
    <summary></summary>
    <link href="https://localhost/hax-art/world-traveler"/>
    
    <content type="html">
      <![CDATA[ <p>The Future Traveler, HAX's official mascot, traveled to the future to bring our ideas to life. He moves through time, taking the best ideas of every era and carrying them into the future, where data flows like water. He is a variant of the <code>rpg-character</code>, itself a caricature of HAX's creator.</p>
<p>He is on-model when he has a red helmet with a HAX visor band, steampunk goggles, a lightbulb on a stalk and a green backpack. The variants change the style and the setting, never those features. Filter the grid below by role.</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/tree/main/world-traveler">Character sheet and story on GitHub</a></li></ul> ]]>
    </content>
  </entry>
